# Vertical List

The simplest setup — a single `DndDroppable` with `strategy={sortable()}` (vertical is the default layout).

This example uses 50 items to demonstrate **auto-scroll** near the container edges.

The `onDrop` callback receives the drop `position` — splice the source item out and insert it at the new position.

